[{"client_msg_id":"907c2001-7d83-4899-8f95-d7fd4cea8ff6","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"\u0026gt; 渡島１１月～翌３月、石狩・後志４月～６月、網走１０月～翌３月、十勝・釧路周年\nなるほど北海道、広すぎんだな","ts":"1616765248.042100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lmp7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9deb548c-3462-4d5e-973f-e4495e253a70","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"春牡蠣って広島じゃないですか？","ts":"1616765121.041400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jd9J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73923513-7248-4D3E-BEC7-034531473C45","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そういえば、4月は北海道のカキシーズンなんでしたっけ？","ts":"1616764949.040400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gsp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3767aa46-c318-4081-b60c-6208d3ebc501","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"美味いですからねぇー","ts":"1616764948.040300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tNsCI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"071615C7-15A5-4B2D-AFFC-C2FAD8EBF756","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"なるほど。しかし、それでもラーメンドンブリ一杯くらい食べたい。","ts":"1616764936.039900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gJ=G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edb3c5ab-173f-480a-9493-fa1ed6313c50","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"原因不明ながら、よく中る食べ物なのです","ts":"1616764875.038200","edited":{"user":"UGXMRNBUM","ts":"1616764913.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U76GA7MFA","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1et3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2d206e2-29e6-4833-80d0-a193fe41f1ba","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"コゴミは、きっっっっっちり熱を遠さないといけなくて、あんまり食べすぎるものではないのですよ","ts":"1616764860.037700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kBD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d6e8f74-d1b6-42ec-9cbe-0173a4a81d44","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"貝も良さそう。アサリ、ハマグリ、トコブシ。 \u003chttps://foodslink.jp/syokuzaihyakka/syun/monthly/avril-fi.htm\u003e","ts":"1616764846.036900","attachments":[{"fallback":"４月の魚介一覧：旬の魚介百科","id":1,"title":"４月の魚介一覧：旬の魚介百科","title_link":"https://foodslink.jp/syokuzaihyakka/syun/monthly/avril-fi.htm","text":"4月が食べ頃の旬にあたる魚や貝類、イカやタコ、エビ、カニなどの魚介類の一覧で各画像をクリックすればそれぞれの詳細ページにジャンプします。プロの方も、美味しいものを美味しい時期に提供するために活用してください","blocks":null,"service_name":"foodslink.jp","service_icon":"https://foodslink.jp/syokuzaihyakka/rogo/fish-icon1.ico","from_url":"https://foodslink.jp/syokuzaihyakka/syun/monthly/avril-fi.htm","original_url":"https://foodslink.jp/syokuzaihyakka/syun/monthly/avril-fi.htm"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2WwfE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DBDB9298-B56A-46A0-8197-3D56D382AC0F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"毒性は無さそうだけど、お通じが良くなったレベルではなくですかね？","ts":"1616764804.036000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jRQAd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b14af80-fd62-4c47-8419-b0d8d1df31cb","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"大量に食って派手に腹を下した僕が通りますね","ts":"1616764732.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"slx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2A4619D6-AEDD-47E3-9617-40AEC4592414","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"コゴミ大量に食べたい","ts":"1616764716.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zyX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e63c082-201b-40d6-a064-072d7b3ecee1","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"まぁでも例えるならアスパラか…","ts":"1616764555.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DYTUA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98deb434-75b3-4ec9-be80-61408daa8a94","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"アスパラほど優しくは無いｗ","ts":"1616764515.032100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uyi9B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"153f3ea2-4d7f-42e9-9360-254f00fe1800","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"コゴミ、知らない人向けに言うと、コゴミは yet another アスパラガスのような感じです","ts":"1616764503.031800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"thinking_face","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Oos"}]},{"client_msg_id":"776ac8ea-51c4-4947-9717-f242ccb08351","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"コゴミは食感がちょっぴり苦手。全然食べられるんですけど。","ts":"1616764425.031000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VXuv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad14e4b6-d3d4-4af7-be71-9f2a83275888","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"コゴミもノビルも食べたいな…","ts":"1616764368.030400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ke=Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"165a3093-fbd2-46bd-bba8-882ac182e1e9","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"今年は温かいから、少しくらいは出てきてるかもしれないですねぇ","ts":"1616764335.029600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a=CBl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99c43a84-c8e6-425a-b05f-2501c16aa4d0","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"コゴミ、さすがにまだか","ts":"1616764290.028700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nnR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f32085f7-8458-4509-8ba4-ebf8c200e763","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"コゴミは生えてるところは無限に生えてますよねアレ","ts":"1616764279.028400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mEL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e05d9d8-ccc8-4a2f-a3d0-9b598f7d5b47","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"ノビルは食べていないですね。いい感じに仕上げてもらおう。","ts":"1616764235.028100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PPer"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f07ef50c-8e52-4b31-988b-fdcd8c679fff","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"サワラとかの焼き魚と合うので好きな野草 \u0026gt; のびる","ts":"1616764204.027600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ung"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5db54342-884e-4177-ae55-4015c80d833f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"コゴミ、茹でてマヨネーズと醤油と一味で食べるのがオススメです","ts":"1616764194.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qYmk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9de83245-637f-40ad-9100-90073756cd26","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"あぁ、やはりそうか。","ts":"1616764177.026700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A=RzQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f26815dc-a9a0-4b8c-abbd-0c7653182e90","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ノビルって今くらいでしたっけ","ts":"1616764051.026500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tT8w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21e1ab79-8812-4602-bc1d-52aa5dbf3e61","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"コゴミはいいぞ","ts":"1616764039.026200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id"